        <mxCell id="n4" parent="1" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;" value="One Go engine. Checkout returns authorize_url on the gRPC. Capture, void, the webhook, and a rider payout are one command. Statement is a mode of this app, not a second service. One transactions table. brand_id on every hop." vertex="1">
